00&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0-PcNq9kKxEQ7kNvwF3msce&_nc_oc=AdpiViBD8YfZrgSwLICy9JpR4nPPOajKHo2wGaUtYutSzN_UJkGaHsZgpc-4yRXIGCI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9M4iZc6XSudpNHEqMW5621D9QwmWPM-GbYgcwvQny3Iw&oe=6A3FC661"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_PointLookout.png", "id": "884501107671984", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300738_884501111005317_4116624426097535501_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UwgFAZ7UJrsQ7kNvwGStK7i&_nc_oc=AdrXeceuPTwsIteX8mRpipnqs38TFEnRubMLoiCsjpLhZhxB0p0Wz9laWUJTEl5kmD0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_XTOsxecQo81RNN3EqkKZC_UyVtSXzQ1InokN4_xwI4Q&oe=6A3FD565"}, "display_name": "Sea Level Rise Explorer: Point Lookout", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Sea Level Rise Explorer: Point Lookout brings you into Point Lookout State Park through an immersive VR experience built with 360-degree video, aerial drone footage, and interactive 3D models.\n\nFrom above the tree line to ground-level views of campgrounds and shorelines, you can see how sea level rise is already transforming the park, and explore nature-based solutions such as marsh restoration, oyster reefs, and climate-resilient planning.\n\nDesigned as both an educational tool and a platform for public engagement, the experience invites you to explore, interact, and better understand how today\u2019s choices can shape the future of coastal places.", "short_description": "Experience Point Lookout State Park through in immersive VR built with 360-degree video, aerial drone footage, and interactive 3D models. From above the tree line to ground-level views of campgrounds and shorelines, you can see how sea level rise is already transforming the park, and explore nature-based solutions such as marsh restoration, oyster reefs, and climate-resilient infrastructure planning."}]}, "developer_name": null, 